*.pkgbak

# Bundled MCP binary: a ~22 MB PyInstaller artifact built from packages/mcp. It is
# (re)built automatically by scripts/build-mcp.mjs when `npm run pack`/`dist` detect it is
# stale vs the packages/mcp sources (see PACKAGING.md), never committed. The .build.json
# sidecar records the source digest the binary was built from — the staleness check.
# (resources/winhook/winhook.dylib + unityhook.dll stay tracked — leave them as-is.)
resources/mcp/satura-space-mcp
resources/mcp/satura-space-mcp.exe
resources/mcp/*.build.json

electron.vite.config.*.mjs
